      "stem_text": "There is a committee composed of eight women and two men. When they meet, they sit in a\nrow---the women in indistinguishable rocking chairs and the men on indistinguishable\nstools. How many distinct ways are there for me to arrange the eight chairs and two stools\nfor a meeting?",
